{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "48d2884cbe978f50ca7c8c7d6e1e9a3b091d95778a385b267b8940567f64cbfb", "ja": "（響と最新のスムージーについて勉強するため\n約束をしていたが、待ち合わせに遅れてしまった……）", "zh": "（本来约好了要和响一起研究最新的冰沙，结果却赶赴约地点迟到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8b9e0ca33ebc58161957ea92ce9dee3b901f3c0a322bda6e16e7cb2ac0c2658", "ja": "ハア……ハア……す、すまない、響！\nだいぶ待たせちゃったな！", "zh": "呼……呼……对、对不起，响！\n让你等了这么久！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "8f4dea325f4f0cf63aa3e9bf2ac617c6e55fb3d6c8a8ccc4482b6dbfc32361a1", "ja": "本当だぞ、{$P$}！\n何かあったんじゃないかって、心配したんだからね！", "zh": "就是嘛，{$P$}！我还担心你是不是出了什么事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76e64a88d8954fe06c5591f41fd0c46d2b34d72f054e676d99ad68e30a5a5814", "ja": "申し訳ない……！　急ぎで対応しなきゃいけない仕事が\nあって、劇場に寄ってたら、こんな大遅刻に……。", "zh": "对不起……！有工作必须赶紧处理，顺道去了趟剧场，结果就迟到这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1004_p", "source_sha256": "31793ef5f9e15c33241df5b6bb80a883dea01b9df7cfd229f845c4ea1721af38", "ja": "一応、劇場を出る前に、\n響にメッセージを送ったはずだけど……。", "zh": "离开剧场前，我应该有给响发过消息才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "000f33902b6e980c36fa13515015cad5862ed5ba3252327ee083e2b39bac910d", "ja": "メッセージ……？\n自分のとこには、何もきてないぞ。", "zh": "消息……？\n我这边什么都没收到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1006_p", "source_sha256": "df7c4206423a48cb9110c967c9a52765de9429d4ee8cb13223e945fc12bf6b93", "ja": "えっ！？　……ああっ！\n送信したと思ったのに、失敗してたみたいだ……。", "zh": "诶！？……啊！\n我还以为已经发送了，没想到好像失败了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "1948aba9e65723fbb13d0139a55e2edb543419d1c160749e10114d1687146295", "ja": "{$P$}……\n慌ててたのはわかるけど、ちゃんと確認しないと。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我知道你当时很慌，但还是得好好确认一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1008_p", "source_sha256": "238639828c693d956be9d9ec5e2e6bcb3238faa1d514b67fa29e47c91fb88697", "ja": "ほんとだな……。\n何度も心配をかけて、反省してます……。", "zh": "确实是这样……\n让你担心了这么多次，我正在反省……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1009_p", "source_sha256": "609b929b6bd281295c816eb768218d3f5b3f88a1cc771e789b9fdb8e661a8de7", "ja": "もしも、これが逆の立場だったらって考えると、\nやっぱり不安だもんな……。", "zh": "要是换成是相反的立场，仔细想想，\n果然还是会觉得不安啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "0ea759fbcf83c278bc3787112c65d6da24071793ebdeda4b153d7ea919075415", "ja": "……{$P$}も、\n自分と連絡がつかなくなったら、心配してくれる？", "zh": "……{$P$}也是，\n要是联系不上响的话，也会担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1011_p", "source_sha256": "80286caeac688adec7f7ac37a4733107c1057d8e97adda88ac3816fa515c2718", "ja": "当たり前だろ？\n響は、それだけ大事な存在なんだから。", "zh": "那当然了。\n因为响对我来说，就是这么重要的存在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "8ddeb8b153ddf3b8fe8bc7a6d5a694de6a427616ee14475fb531078c769637e7", "ja": "{$P$}も、自分と同じ……へへっ。", "zh": "{$P$}也和自己一样……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1013_p", "source_sha256": "502003443ef1e25eedf698b3ae03c969903cbdb988387ea54de88caa857475e8", "ja": "ん？　どうした？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "84bc417d5b1b225f3ddc4e872ab68a636d512e5d78cca5e03420a1ce7939869e", "ja": "ううん、何でもない。それより、早く行こうっ！\n行きたいお店、たくさんあるんだからね。", "zh": "没有，没什么啦。比起这个，快走吧！\n我想去很多家店呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1be0c6a3496058ed3a753342ea3c5eba4617df75fad8d2d5d3ef8d5ffeca35c7", "ja": "えっ！？\nスムージーが飲めるお店って、そんなにあるのか？", "zh": "诶！？\n能喝到冰沙的店，有那么多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "88d15ddb9c0ec1b5f5044fd419c33ee882a31729c32a13949d50a5b3233cb973", "ja": "そうだぞ？　今日のために、\nしっかりバッチリ、チェックしてきたんだ。", "zh": "是啊！为了今天，我可是好好地、彻彻底底地查过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1017_p", "source_sha256": "700edf0903f66f04bcea29ea2a3a1334c3f070ced4c4a9178927c9d2bb63ec14", "ja": "調べてきてくれたのは助かるけど……\nそんなに気合いが入ってるとは。", "zh": "你能帮忙调查清楚，真是帮大忙了……没想到你竟然这么有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "20a37518790d823c4398cc4d7621fcb9147214cb72ca92595df9cabbbfaed40f", "ja": "当然さー！\n自分、スムージーのお仕事を成功させたいからね。", "zh": "那是当然啦！\n毕竟我可是很想把冰沙的这份工作做好的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "eed53ee86101d2dfdc9ead649a9e696035c4154e4344800759401d929f4b3cd1", "ja": "お店のPRになって、この服の宣伝にもなる！\nついでに、沖縄のフルーツもアピールできて……。", "zh": "既能宣传店铺，还能宣传这身衣服！\n顺便还能推广冲绳的水果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "c471d2a598f4b941e4991f1076829fa6a1413271bd28eb4c94eb4e6ea2a84b51", "ja": "一石二鳥！　……いや、三鳥だぞ！", "zh": "一石二鸟！……不对，是一石三鸟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1021_p", "source_sha256": "435e899022275f4be940e319e1d64ea2223e0927a2a44ef7a841aefabfc1bb4f", "ja": "そんなことまで考えてたのか……！", "zh": "连这种事你都考虑到了吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c876256d4c3eb4ea7b3f9bd2a6595fff250a8959928e1714820307d59111666", "ja": "新しい自分に挑戦するなら、徹底的にやらないとね！\n{$P$}も覚悟はいい？", "zh": "既然要挑战崭新的自己，就必须贯彻到底才行呢！\n{$P$}做好心理准备了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "29e5d4516a6c2d9de0fbce8c1d6554e36fcd51e19eed5b9f7bf451f6180a04b9", "ja": "今日は、スムージー祭り！\nお腹いっぱいになるまで、飲むぞー！　おーっ！", "zh": "今天是奶昔节！\n我要喝到肚子撑饱为止——！噢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0514_1024_p", "source_sha256": "006a82187594851572f9ea2f1dd519edf943107783e037f6668b697f50e9111b", "ja": "（それから、響と一緒にスムージーを飲みまくった。\n響の挑戦を後押ししたいが……もうお腹はいっぱいだ）", "zh": "（之后，和响一起痛痛快快地喝了好多冰沙。虽然想支持响的挑战……但肚子已经吃饱了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
